id.instance: String (TS "c<n>")
num.game: i32
num.cursor: u32
map.ordered: IndexMap
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value>
error.style: Result<_, EngineError> with TS's message; panic only on invariants (a stuck settle/dispatch loop panics with TS's thrown message)
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: &mut GameState writes, &GameState reads, &mut EngineSink for TS sink mutators
rng.source: Rng::new(&state.seed, state.rng_cursor) and write the cursor back
hook.style: Arc<dyn Fn + Send + Sync> via hook(); no fn pointers, no Box
registry.style: OnceLock set once by register_all; fused scripts built on lookup from state
async.style: tokio in crates/server only; none in pure crates
log.style: tracing JSON to stdout, server only
sink.frontier: EngineSink.frontier: triggers::FrontierSlot (Own in new, Shared in reborrow) replaces TS's identity WeakSets and SettleSink.dispatched
instance.args: &CardInstance snapshot, live card re-read by id; place_on_field takes an owned CardInstance
anon.args: TS anonymous object arguments become separate arguments (lethal_hit_window, answer_targeting)
apply_resumable.args: (ctx, plan, effects, paused) — TS's sink argument dropped
lazy.closures: TS () => T closures over the sink become &dyn Fn(&EngineSink) -> T
